  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### SA100 Dashboard\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 1 Mar, 2024 at  3:50 PM\n\n### Location: Self Assessment > SA100 > Client Specific > Dashboard\n\n### \n\n### Alternatively, you may click on this link to be redirected to the page\n\n### \n\n### Select the client for who Personal Tax return is to be filled from the client drop-down list from the Capium Dashboard. It could be filled for two types of clients:\n\n### Individual clients    \n\n### Sole Trader clients\n\n### \n\n### Once you select the client you can see the client’s dashboard which has 3 sections:\n\nClient Details: this shows the basic details of the client, you can also edit the client details\n\nTax Summary: this shows the basic taxable and tax payable details\n\nSA100 Forms: this shows SA100 returns that have been generated, you can also add new SA100 from here.\n\n### \n\n### \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
