;, Times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\">Alternatively, you may click on</span><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/selfassessment/sa100/\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-weight: 400; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\">this link</span></a><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\">&nbsp;to be redirected to the page</span><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"></span></span></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"></span></span></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\">Select the client for who Personal Tax return is to be filled from the client drop-down list from the Capium Dashboard. It could be filled for two types of clients:</span></span></span></h4><ol style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><li style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><h4 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quo